  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Classic quilting. Polished chain strap. Some things stick around for a reason. Our Carey chain camera bag in quilted leather keeps everything secure and within reach—a zip closure locks it down, and slip pockets inside and out mean nothing gets lost. It's a small bag with a big attitude.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Smooth Quilted Leather</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> 2 Way Script Logo Lining</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Strap drop: 22&quot; when buckled at center hole</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior: slip pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip closure</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Gold hardware (black, meringue); silver hardware (lemon fondant, crisp sky, elm)</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 7.9&quot; (L) x 5.3&quot; (H) x 2.20&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
